  "verbalization": "Rubiyunnanin F appears to have multiple targets that ultimately lead to SCCH-26 through a series of molecular interactions. The evidence suggests that Rubiyunnanin F directly targets SNU-387, which is a target of Npc13565 and of Caffeic Acid 3,4-Dihydroxyphenethyl Ester, and 3-Methylundecane. These compounds, in turn, target SCCH-26, indicating a chain of molecular interactions that ultimately result in the effect on the SCCH-26 cell line. The integration of these pathways highlights a potential mechanism where Rubiyunnanin F influences downstream targets that modulate SCCH-26 through a complex network of interactions. The evidence supports a role for Rubiyunnanin F in modulating SCCH-26 through a series of intermediate targets, suggesting a possible pharmacological mechanism involving multiple molecular pathways.",
